%H A400429 Iwan Jensen, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/0008178">A transfer matrix approach to the enumeration of plane meanders</a>, arXiv:cond-mat/0008178 [cond-mat.stat-mech], 2000.
%H A400429 Iwan Jensen, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1088/0305-4470/33/34/301">A transfer matrix approach to the enumeration of plane meanders</a>, J. Phys. A: Math. Gen. 33 (34) (2000), 5953-5963.
%H A400429 Joe Sawada and Roy Li, <a href="https://doi.org/10.37236/2404">Stamp Foldings, Semi-Meanders, and Open Meanders: Fast Generation Algorithms</a>, The Electronic Journal of Combinatorics, Volume 19 No. 2 (2012), P#43 (16 pages).
%F A400429 T(n,1) = A005315(ceiling(n/2)).
%F A400429 T(2*n,2) = A005315(n+1) - 2*A005316(2*n), for n >= 2.
%F A400429 Sum_{k=1..floor(n/2)} T(n,k) = A000682(n).
%F A400429 Sum_{k=1..floor(n/2)} T(n,k) * n = A000136(n).
%F A400429 Let D_j(n) = T(n,floor(n/2)-j+1) denote the j-th diagonal, for 1 <= j <= floor(n/2).
%F A400429 D_1(n) = 2 - 0^(n-2).
%F A400429 Conjecture: D_2(n) = (n^2 + 2*n + n mod 2 - 20)/2, for n >= 4.
%F A400429 Conjecture: D_3(n) = [13*n^4 + 24*n^3 - 284*n^2 - 4560*n + 17920 + (n MOD 2)*(18*n^2 - 72*n + 189) - 0^(n MOD 3)*64]/288, for n >= 6.
%F A400429 A005316(n) = T(n,1) + (1 - n mod 2) * [T(n,2) - T(n-1,2)]/2, for n >= 5.
%F A400429 A076876(n)   = [T(n,3) -     T(n,2) +     T(n+1,1) - 2 * T(n+1,2) + T(n+2,2)]/2, for even n >= 6.
%F A400429 A006661(n+4) = [T(n,3) - 2 * T(n,2) + 2 * T(n+1,1) - 2 * T(n+1,2) + T(n+2,2)]/2, for even n >= 6.
%F A400429 A077054(n) = [T(2*n+1,1) - T(2*n,2)]/2, for n >= 2.
%F A400429 A077460(n) = [T(2*n,1) + T(n+1,1) - T(n,2)]/4, for even n >= 2.
%F A400429 A077460(n) = [T(2*n,1) + T(n,  1) + Sum_{k=1..floor(n/2)} T(n,k)]/4, for odd n >= 3.
%F A400429 T(n,k) = a(i), where i = 1 + k + floor((n-1)^2/4).
%F A400429 Conversely, a(i) = T(n,k), where n = ceiling(2*sqrt(i-1)) and k = i - 1 - floor((n-1)^2/4).
%e A400429 Rows n = 2..12, with k increasing from 1:
